// SRD 5.1 spell (docs/dnd.srd.5.1/07_Spells). Points default to the level; cantrips are free.
// Non-consumed SRD components are dropped (PRD §8.3); consumed ones go in `components`.
// `effect` is the shape of what the spell does; the numbers are rule slots in data/rules/casting.ron.
// Durations are party-clock minutes: a fight round is one minute, so the SRD's "1 minute" is 10.
// Three darts of 1d4 + 1, all at the lead individual of the stack (a split is a horizon).
(schema: 1, id: "base:spell:magic_missile", name: "base:text:spell.magic_missile.name", level: 1, school: Evocation, classes: ["base:class:wizard"], concentration: false, ritual: false, description: "base:text:spell.magic_missile.description", effect: Some(AutoHit(dice: (count: 3, sides: 4, modifier: 3), damage_type: Force)), reach: One)
